      "writtenOn": "2020-12-04T02:48:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are we using\n\nconfig.environ.Set\n\nBut also\n\ncmd.Environment.Set\n\nIs there a difference? Can we standardize on one of them?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 99,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "e8486937cbf4757f9190d8c108f8ff5aee727ca4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "949e18dc_7db4241d",
        "filename": "ui/build/bazel.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 99,
      "author": {
        "id": 1514900
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-04T04:25:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes there\u0027s a difference. cmd.Environment is local to the cmd, which can differ based on the process soong_ui launches, so it shouldn\u0027t be directly mapped from config.environ.",
      "parentUuid": "ccd3b1fa_d47d07b6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 99,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "e8486937cbf4757f9190d8c108f8ff5aee727ca4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "39a72623_2f2fb2e7",
        "filename": "ui/build/bazel.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
