      "lineNbr": 99,
      "author": {
        "id": 1726181
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-04T05:56:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. So, earlier in the same function we use config.environ.Set() instead...\n\nconfig.environ.Set(\"COMBINED_NINJA\", config.CombinedNinjaFile())\nconfig.environ.Set(\"KATI_NINJA\", config.KatiBuildNinjaFile())\nconfig.environ.Set(\"PACKAGE_NINJA\", config.KatiPackageNinjaFile())\nconfig.environ.Set(\"SOONG_NINJA\", config.SoongNinjaFile())\n\nJust double checking that is intentional? \n\nrunBazel() is the last step of build.go, so I\u0027m assuming the only commands that Soong still has yet to launch are the two commands here in this function\n\nLooking more closely, the two commands here also set the same environment variables\n\ncmd.Environment.Set(\"DIST_DIR\", config.DistDir())\ncmd.Environment.Set(\"SHELL\", \"/bin/bash\")\n\ninfoCmd.Environment.Set(\"DIST_DIR\", config.DistDir())\ninfoCmd.Environment.Set(\"SHELL\", \"/bin/bash\")\n\nMaybe we should just set those once using config.environ.Set() instead?\n\n(Sorry if I\u0027m misunderstanding something...)",
      "parentUuid": "949e18dc_7db4241d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 99,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "e8486937cbf4757f9190d8c108f8ff5aee727ca4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
